sment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn7le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn7le14ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn7le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn7le14ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Peter, help! Ricardo Verde needs wheelchair access.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure I follow you. What happened to Ricardo?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: His daughter-in-law broke her leg last week but wants to attend.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Isn't this three days away? I don't think we can find a new building.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Exactly. Ricardo is sensitive. If his daughter-in-law isn't provided for, he will cancel."}, {"time": "24000", "image": "engenn7le14ob09re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What would you say to helping her up the stairs?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: No, he's very contrary, if you ask me. Now he's blaming me for choosing a non-accessible facility. He's really crusty!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: He's demanding! I say we build a ramp. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: You mean a wheelchair ramp? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes! I strongly believe the company we hired for the catwalk will have something.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Don't you think it would be dangerous without a rail? Ricardo will throw a tantrum."}, {"time": "54000", "image": "engenn7le14ob09re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hmmmm. What's your opinion of a temporary fence? I'd say it might not meet safety codes, but just this once ... <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Eh? What are you talking about?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Potted plants. We could rent solid urns with flowers to line each side of the ramp.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: You are inventive!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hire a porter for the front door and I'll take care of the inside."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Reaching an Agreement"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Hitch"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le14ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Dealing with Communication Breakdown"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Sometimes you don't understand what was said or something was not clear to you. It is, therefore, important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressing lack of understanding \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>I'm not sure I follow you.</li><li>Eh?</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>What happened to ... ?</li><li>Isn't ... ?</li><li>You mean ... ?</li><li>What are you talking about?</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: We need to make special arrangements.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ian</span>: <span class=\"underline\">I'm not sure I follow you. What are you talking about?</span> <br/><span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: We need to provide wheelchair access. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ron</span>: I don't think we can meet the safety codes. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Ian</span>: <span class=\"underline\">Eh? You mean</span> fire hazards?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving Opinions "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Conversations are far more interesting when people interact during the conversation. It is important to ask for others' opinions on a subject as well as giving your own. Here are some ways you can give opinions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>I (don't) think ... + clause  </li><li>What would you say to ... + verb + -ing ?  </li><li>... if you ask me. </li><li>I say ... + clause </li><li>I strongly believe (that) + clause  </li><li>Don't you think ... + clause?  </li><li>What's your opinion of + noun / -ing?  </li><li>I'd say ... + clause  </li><li>A verb in the imperative form - Hire / Move, etc. </li></ul></span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">I don't think</span> we can find a new building. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">What would you say to</span> making special arrangements?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "He's very contrary, <span class=\"underline\">if you ask me</span>. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">I strongly believe</span> we need to have wheelchair access. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">What's your opinion of</span> building a temporary fence?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">Hire</span> someone to work the front door and see to the guests. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sensitive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "likely to become angry or upset easily"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ricardo is a very sensitive man. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about people's behavior and personality."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "contrary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "inclined to disagree or to do the opposite of what is expected or desired"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He's very contrary to the idea of using the stairs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "crusty"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "easily annoyed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He's blaming me for that. He's really crusty. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "throw a tantrum"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to suddenly behave in a very angry and unreasonable way "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If we don't do it, Ricardo will throw a tantrum. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inventive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "good at thinking of new and original ideas "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter, you're so inventive. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le14ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have organized an office party for your company. However, you have some problems to deal with."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Brainstorm and write down some problems you might have before the party (For example, provide wheelchair access)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue of 10-12 lines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In your dialogue, use expressions for dealing with communication breakdown and give opinions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you are finished, read your dialogue to a partner. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about problems I might have before a party."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use language for dealing with communication breakdown."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my opinions."}]}]}